category: Libs
requires: cygwin libflint16 libgcc1 libgmp10 libgmpxx4 libgomp1 libssl3 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Open source tool for computations in affine monoids, vector configurations, lattice polytopes, and rational cones (runtime)"
ldesc: "Normaliz is an open source tool for computations in affine monoids, vector
configurations, lattice polytopes, and rational cones. Normaliz also computes
algebraic polyhedra, i.e., polyhedra defined over real algebraic extensions of
Q."
external-source: normaliz

